stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: create
  draft --> submitted: submit\n(policy validate)
  returned --> submitted: resubmit\n(policy validate)
  submitted --> under_review: start_review\n(standard/formal)
  submitted --> approved: approve\n(simple mode)
  submitted --> returned: return + reason
  submitted --> rejected: reject + reason
  under_review --> returned: return + reason
  under_review --> pending_approval: recommend_approve
  under_review --> approved: approve\n(exec)
  under_review --> rejected: reject + reason
  pending_approval --> approved: approve
  pending_approval --> returned: return + reason
  pending_approval --> rejected: reject + reason
  rejected --> submitted: resubmit
  approved --> active: activate\n(activation policy)
  active --> on_hold: suspend + reason
  on_hold --> active: resume
  active --> closed: close + reason
  approved --> closed: close + reason
  on_hold --> closed: close + reason
  rejected --> closed: close + reason
  closed --> archived: archive

  note right of approved
    SoD when policy.separationOfDuties:
    approver ≠ submitter.
    Exact path from OrgPortfolioPolicy.workflowMode.
  end note
